     *     Required. A collection of CSS rules.
     *
     *     @type array ...$0 {
     *         @type string   $rules_group  A parent CSS selector in the case of nested CSS, or a CSS nested @rule, such as `@media (min-width: 80rem)` or `@layer module`.
